# Setup

## Database
We are using a centralized database for simplified development. Ask Andrew for connection details and to be added to IP allow-list.

We now use the Secret Manager for the connection details.
Everyone needs to run `dotnet user-secrets set "DefaultPassword" "{replace with password from Andrew}"` on their machine from the project directory (which is the default location when you open terminal).

Source: [Microsoft Documentation](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/aspnet/core/security/app-secrets?view=aspnetcore-10.0&tabs=windows%2Cpowershell#set-a-secret)